 - `'electron'`: `argv[0]` is the application and `argv[1]` varies depending on whether the electron application is packaged
 - `'user'`: just user arguments
 
+Electron is auto-detected using `process.versions.electron`, except when `ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE` is set in the environment. The Electron executable then runs the script like node does, so the node conventions are used.
+
